Troubleshooting Quick Ref
Issue	Fix
VM won't boot	virsh console <vm> → check cloud-init logs
K8s join fails	ssh master "kubeadm token create --print-join-command" → re-run worker play
Vault unsealed but no token	../scripts/bootstrap-vault-secret.sh
Pod CrashLoopBackOff	kubectl logs -n devops-platform <pod> --previous
/readyz fails	Check Vault connectivity: kubectl exec <pod> -- curl $VAULT_ADDR/v1/sys/health
Trivy fails	Update base image in Dockerfile, rebuild
Reset / Cleanup
# Destroy K8s (opt-in, requires confirmation)
cd ansible && ansible-playbook playbook.yml --tags reset -e reset_confirmed=true

# Destroy VMs
cd terraform && terraform destroy -auto-approve